        <p>RADIANT CHRISTMAS FAIR.</p>
        <p>THE FOLLOWING ARE ALL. VERY SPECIAL PURCHASES AND RARE VALUE:- 960 PAIRS LADIES' EMBROIDERED HOSE, in cashmere, beautifully hand-worked in 50 new designs, high-spliced heels and toes. Wonderful Value at is. 111 d. the Pair.</p>
      </div>
