        <p>for double beds, covered in choice new designs and rich colourings, all most remarkable value. Prices in sateen, Ms. 9d. to 295. 9d. ; in satin and sateen, 11s. Ild. to 38s. 6d. ; in all satin or silk damask, 17s. 6d. to 80s. each.</p>
        <p>LARGE RANGES OF FUR GARMENTS at Very Special Christmas Prices, comprising choice Sables, Marten, For, and all skins now in favour in Necklets, Stoles, Muffs, Coats, &amp;c. ; in charming New Styles.</p>
        <p>950 LADIES' STYLISH FELT HATS, in navy, red, sky, beaver, and white; trimmed with cord for Girls and Boys. All to be sold at is. Old., and ls. 6141. each. Worth 4s. 11d. to ss. 11d.</p>
